---
// Say the model's context window holds 128,000 tokens. A system prompt takes 3,000, ten tool results of 4,000 each
// take 40,000, and the full filing takes 80,000: 123,000 used, 5,000 left. (python3: 3000+40000+80000 = 123000; 128000-123000 = 5000.)
const TOTAL = 128000;
const parts = [
  { v: 3000, en: 'System prompt 3,000', vi: 'System prompt 3.000', cls: 'p0' },
  { v: 40000, en: '10 tool results x 4,000 = 40,000', vi: '10 kết quả tool x 4.000 = 40.000', cls: 'p1' },
  { v: 80000, en: 'The whole filing 80,000', vi: 'Cả báo cáo 80.000', cls: 'p2' },
  { v: 5000, en: 'Left 5,000', vi: 'Còn 5.000', cls: 'p3' },
];
const BX = 20;
const BW = 860;
let acc = 0;
const segs = parts.map((p) => { const x = BX + (acc / TOTAL) * BW; const w = (p.v / TOTAL) * BW; acc += p.v; return { ...p, x, w }; });
const tiers = [
  { en: 'In the window', vi: 'Trong cửa sổ', sub: { en: 'working memory: gone when the run ends', vi: 'trí nhớ làm việc: hết khi lượt chạy kết thúc' } },
  { en: 'Notes file', vi: 'File ghi chú', sub: { en: 'the agent writes findings down and re-reads them', vi: 'agent ghi kết quả ra rồi đọc lại' } },
  { en: 'Store you search', vi: 'Kho để tìm', sub: { en: 'past reports and decisions, fetched when needed', vi: 'báo cáo và quyết định cũ, lấy khi cần' } },
];
---
<figure class="a21c">
  <div class="a21c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="A 128,000-token context window: a 3,000-token system prompt, ten tool results of 4,000 tokens each making 40,000, a whole 80,000-token filing, and 5,000 tokens left. Below, three memory tiers: the window itself, a notes file the agent writes and re-reads, and a store that is searched on demand.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="a21c-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Context is a budget: say the window holds 128,000 tokens</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Context là một ngân sách: giả sử cửa sổ chứa 128.000 token</tspan></text>
      {segs.map((s) => (
        <rect x={s.x} y="52" width={s.w} height="40" class={`a21c-seg ${s.cls}`} />
      ))}
      <text x={segs[0].x} y="112" class="a21c-s"><tspan data-lang-en>{parts[0].en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{parts[0].vi}</tspan></text>
      <text x={segs[1].x + 4} y="130" class="a21c-s"><tspan data-lang-en>{parts[1].en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{parts[1].vi}</tspan></text>
      <text x={segs[2].x + segs[2].w / 2} y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="a21c-in"><tspan data-lang-en>{parts[2].en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{parts[2].vi}</tspan></text>
      <text x={BX + BW} y="112" text-anchor="end" class="a21c-s is-red"><tspan data-lang-en>{parts[3].en}: one more long tool result will not fit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{parts[3].vi}: thêm một kết quả dài nữa là không vừa</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="176" class="a21c-ct"><tspan data-lang-en>So long jobs need memory outside the window</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vì vậy việc dài cần trí nhớ nằm ngoài cửa sổ</tspan></text>
      {tiers.map((t, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={20 + i * 292} y="192" width="276" height="112" rx="8" class={i === 0 ? 'a21c-tier is-key' : 'a21c-tier'} />
          <text x={20 + i * 292 + 14} y="222" class="a21c-ct"><tspan data-lang-en>{t.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{t.vi}</tspan></text>
          <foreignObject x={20 + i * 292 + 10} y="232" width="256" height="64">
            <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="a21c-fp"><span data-lang-en>{t.sub.en}</span><span data-lang-vi>{t.sub.vi}</span></p>
          </foreignObject>
        </g>
      ))}
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Numbers are a worked example: 3,000 + 40,000 + 80,000 = 123,000 used, 5,000 left. Stuffing the whole filing in leaves no room to think or to call another tool.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số liệu là một ví dụ tính tay: 3.000 + 40.000 + 80.000 = 123.000 đã dùng, còn 5.000. Nhét cả báo cáo vào thì không còn chỗ để suy nghĩ hay gọi thêm tool.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .a21c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .a21c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .a21c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .a21c text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .a21c .a21c-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21c .a21c-ct { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21c .a21c-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .a21c .a21c-s.is-red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .a21c .a21c-in { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21c .a21c-fp { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text-body); font-family: inherit; }
  .a21c-seg { stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .a21c-seg.p0 { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .a21c-seg.p1 { fill: var(--border); }
  .a21c-seg.p2 { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .a21c-seg.p3 { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .a21c-tier { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .a21c-tier.is-key { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .a21c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
